  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 308e3640226ceb346b1cfcac31db9c62, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::SequenceManager
  steps:
  - title: 'Welcome: What Is an ASRS?'
    targets: []
    infoText: "Welcome to Module 1. An Automated Storage and Retrieval System (ASRS)
      stores parts in numbered, addressable cells and uses a robot to put them away
      and bring them back on demand \u2014 so the manufacturing cell always knows
      exactly where every part is."
    instructionsText: In this module you'll meet the three storage station types,
      follow a pallet around the SmartCIM cell, inspect the rack's storage cells,
      load a template into the ASRS and finish with a three-question check. Press
      Next to begin.
    RequiredOccupiedTable: {fileID: 0}
    RequiredLoadedSlottedTable: {fileID: 0}
    requiredActionId: M1_Welcome
    passiveAction: 0
    hintTarget: {fileID: 0}
    advanceOnNext: 1
    stationType: {fileID: 11400000, guid: dea76babc55540e994c3ac7fed8a0568, type: 2}
    narration: {fileID: 0}
    media: {fileID: 0}
    largeText: 0
  - title: 
    targets: []
    infoText: 
    instructionsText: 
    RequiredOccupiedTable: {fileID: 0}
    RequiredLoadedSlottedTable: {fileID: 0}
    requiredActionId: 
    passiveAction: 0
    hintTarget: {fileID: 0}
    advanceOnNext: 1
    stationType: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 6353df69a1d39da4e8f511e413913005, type: 2}
    narration: {fileID: 0}
    media: {fileID: 0}
    largeText: 0
  - title: 
    targets: []
    infoText: 
    instructionsText: 
    RequiredOccupiedTable: {fileID: 0}
    RequiredLoadedSlottedTable: {fileID: 0}
    requiredActionId: 
    passiveAction: 0
    hintTarget: {fileID: 0}
    advanceOnNext: 1
    stationType: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 22945083732c4d642bed72ea41625998, type: 2}
    narration: {fileID: 0}
    media: {fileID: 0}
    largeText: 0
  - title: 
    targets: []
    infoText: 
    instructionsText: 
    RequiredOccupiedTable: {fileID: 0}
    RequiredLoadedSlottedTable: {fileID: 0}
    requiredActionId: 
    passiveAction: 0
    hintTarget: {fileID: 0}
    advanceOnNext: 1
    stationType: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 42f14ec0e6f6c164e95dae2d15449d08, type: 2}
    narration: {fileID: 0}
    media: {fileID: 0}
    largeText: 0
  - title: 'Material Flow 1 of 6: Raw material into storage'
    targets: []
    infoText: "Let's follow one part through the SmartCIM cell. This is a concept
      walkthrough \u2014 the diagram beside you illustrates it; nothing in the real
      rack moves.\n\nRaw materials are loaded into templates, and the loaded templates
      are stored in addressable ASRS cells."
    instructionsText: 
    RequiredOccupiedTable: {fileID: 0}
    RequiredLoadedSlottedTable: {fileID: 0}
    requiredActionId: M1_Flow_1
    passiveAction: 0
    hintTarget: {fileID: 0}
    advanceOnNext: 1
    stationType: {fileID: 0}
    narration: {fileID: 0}
    media: {fileID: 0}
    largeText: 0
  - title: 'Material Flow 2 of 6: Robot retrieval'
    targets: []
    infoText: When a job needs a part, the ASRS robot retrieves the requested template
      from its cell.
    instructionsText: 
    RequiredOccupiedTable: {fileID: 0}
    RequiredLoadedSlottedTable: {fileID: 0}
    requiredActionId: M1_Flow_2
    passiveAction: 0
    hintTarget: {fileID: 0}
    advanceOnNext: 1
    stationType: {fileID: 0}
    narration: {fileID: 0}
    media: {fileID: 0}
    largeText: 0
  - title: 'Material Flow 3 of 6: Conveyor & PLC routing'
    targets: []
    infoText: The template rides a pallet onto the conveyor. PLC-controlled logic
      routes the pallet to the station that needs it.
    instructionsText: 
    RequiredOccupiedTable: {fileID: 0}
    RequiredLoadedSlottedTable: {fileID: 0}
    requiredActionId: M1_Flow_3
    passiveAction: 0
    hintTarget: {fileID: 0}
    advanceOnNext: 1
    stationType: {fileID: 0}
    narration: {fileID: 0}
    media: {fileID: 0}
    largeText: 0
  - title: 'Material Flow 4 of 6: Processing stations'
    targets: []
    infoText: "CNC and assembly stations machine and assemble the parts. (Shown as
      a concept \u2014 those stations aren't modelled in this scene.)"
    instructionsText: 
    RequiredOccupiedTable: {fileID: 0}
    RequiredLoadedSlottedTable: {fileID: 0}
    requiredActionId: M1_Flow_4
    passiveAction: 0
    hintTarget: {fileID: 0}
    advanceOnNext: 1
    stationType: {fileID: 0}
    narration: {fileID: 0}
    media: {fileID: 0}
    largeText: 0
  - title: 'Material Flow 5 of 6: Return conveyor'
    targets: []
    infoText: Processed parts go back onto the conveyor, which carries the pallet
      back toward the ASRS.
    instructionsText: 
    RequiredOccupiedTable: {fileID: 0}
    RequiredLoadedSlottedTable: {fileID: 0}
    requiredActionId: M1_Flow_5
    passiveAction: 0
    hintTarget: {fileID: 0}
    advanceOnNext: 1
    stationType: {fileID: 0}
    narration: {fileID: 0}
    media: {fileID: 0}
    largeText: 0
  - title: 'Material Flow 6 of 6: Finished goods stored'
    targets: []
    infoText: The completed product is stored back in the ASRS as a finished good,
      ready for the next request.
    instructionsText: 
    RequiredOccupiedTable: {fileID: 0}
    RequiredLoadedSlottedTable: {fileID: 0}
    requiredActionId: M1_Flow_6
    passiveAction: 0
    hintTarget: {fileID: 0}
    advanceOnNext: 1
    stationType: {fileID: 0}
    narration: {fileID: 0}
    media: {fileID: 0}
    largeText: 0
  - title: 
    targets: []
    infoText: "The physical SmartCIM ASRS-36u stores 36 templates per unit (6 levels
      \xD7 6 cells). This Unity scene models the larger 72-slot arrangement: two
      36-slot racks, one on each side of the rotating arm."
    instructionsText: Next, you'll identify the parts of the ASRS station in front
      of you.
    RequiredOccupiedTable: {fileID: 0}
    RequiredLoadedSlottedTable: {fileID: 0}
    requiredActionId: 
    passiveAction: 0
    hintTarget: {fileID: 0}
    advanceOnNext: 1
    stationType: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 5e3ff94a78cf4e7698391eea6759619f, type: 2}
    narration: {fileID: 0}
    media: {fileID: 0}
    largeText: 1
  - title: 
    targets:
    - {fileID: 1343739601}
    infoText: This is the slotted table buffer. It holds pallets temporarily when
      a station isn't ready to receive them yet, preventing a backup in the line.
    instructionsText: 'Please interact with the slotted table shown in front of you
      to move onto the next step. '
    RequiredOccupiedTable: {fileID: 0}
    RequiredLoadedSlottedTable: {fileID: 0}
    requiredActionId: 
    passiveAction: 0
    hintTarget: {fileID: 0}
    advanceOnNext: 0
    stationType: {fileID: 0}
    narration: {fileID: 0}
    media: {fileID: 11400000, guid: b858b22e09ee495e8c1a853f772ee83a, type: 2}
    largeText: 1
  - title: 
    targets:
    - {fileID: 254648658}
    infoText: This is the RFID tag on the slotted table. It's what the RFID sensor
      reads to identify this pallet as it passes by. This also helps for indexing
      its position in the storage unit.
    instructionsText: 'Please interact with the RFID tag shown in front of you to
      move onto the next step. '
    RequiredOccupiedTable: {fileID: 0}
    RequiredLoadedSlottedTable: {fileID: 0}
    requiredActionId: 
    passiveAction: 0
    hintTarget: {fileID: 0}
    advanceOnNext: 0
    stationType: {fileID: 0}
    narration: {fileID: 0}
    media: {fileID: 11400000, guid: ad31bdc8172b408fbcef5485173220f2, type: 2}
    largeText: 1
  - title: 
    targets:
    - {fileID: 1643142830}
    infoText: "This is the epoxy block \u2014 one of the standard parts used in this
      CIM cell. Its template is shaped specifically to hold this part and no other."
    instructionsText: 'Please interact with the Epoxy Block shown in front of you
      to move onto the next step. '
    RequiredOccupiedTable: {fileID: 0}
    RequiredLoadedSlottedTable: {fileID: 0}
    requiredActionId: 
    passiveAction: 0
    hintTarget: {fileID: 0}
    advanceOnNext: 0
    stationType: {fileID: 0}
    narration: {fileID: 0}
    media: {fileID: 11400000, guid: c1fa7975137d4183bb9a0a5e42aa2f77, type: 2}
    largeText: 1
  - title: 
    targets:
    - {fileID: 1704333287}
    infoText: "This is the ASRS-36 \u2014 the Automated Storage and Retrieval System.
      It stores loaded templates in a grid of numbered cells and retrieves them again
      on demand, using the RFID tag to track what's stored where.\"\r\n "
    instructionsText: Interact with the ASRS unit to continue before you open it
    RequiredOccupiedTable: {fileID: 0}
    RequiredLoadedSlottedTable: {fileID: 0}
    requiredActionId: 
    passiveAction: 0
    hintTarget: {fileID: 0}
    advanceOnNext: 0
    stationType: {fileID: 0}
    narration: {fileID: 0}
    media: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 5e3ff94a78cf4e7698391eea6759619f, type: 2}
    largeText: 1
  - title: 
    targets:
    - {fileID: 456656642}
    infoText: 'Please walk over to the rack, and interact with the door handle. '
    instructionsText: 
    RequiredOccupiedTable: {fileID: 0}
    RequiredLoadedSlottedTable: {fileID: 0}
    requiredActionId: 
    passiveAction: 0
    hintTarget: {fileID: 0}
    advanceOnNext: 0
    stationType: {fileID: 0}
    narration: {fileID: 0}
    media: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 25e99d2122f94d75abe49251edc9e9a1, type: 2}
    largeText: 1
  - title: Inspect the Storage Cells
    targets: []
    infoText: "Aim your hand's ray at any storage cell in the rack \u2014 it turns
      solid white over a cell \u2014 and pull the index-finger trigger (left hand
      recommended; on desktop, aim with the screen centre and left-click). The cell
      panel shows its address, whether it's occupied, the template stored there and
      what material it holds. Inspect three different cells to continue."
    instructionsText: 
    RequiredOccupiedTable: {fileID: 0}
    RequiredLoadedSlottedTable: {fileID: 0}
    requiredActionId: M1_InspectCells
    passiveAction: 0
    hintTarget: {fileID: 0}
    advanceOnNext: 0
    stationType: {fileID: 0}
    narration: {fileID: 0}
    media: {fileID: 0}
    largeText: 0
  - title: Find the Material
    targets: []
    infoText: "Now use the rack's inventory to find a part: select a cell that stores
      the material named on the cell panel. A wrong pick just tells you what that
      cell holds \u2014 nothing in the rack changes."
    instructionsText: 
    RequiredOccupiedTable: {fileID: 0}
    RequiredLoadedSlottedTable: {fileID: 0}
    requiredActionId: M1_IdentifyMaterial
    passiveAction: 0
    hintTarget: {fileID: 0}
    advanceOnNext: 0
    stationType: {fileID: 0}
    narration: {fileID: 0}
    media: {fileID: 0}
    largeText: 0
  - title: 
    targets: []
    infoText: 'Perform the following action of loading the loaded slotted table into
      the asrs

'
    instructionsText: "Point at the loaded slotted table and pull the trigger to
      put it in your inventory. Then point at its home cell (outlined in the rack)
      and pull the trigger to load it \u2014 you can only load it while a slotted
      table is in your inventory. Carrying it in by hand works too."
    RequiredOccupiedTable: {fileID: 0}
    RequiredLoadedSlottedTable: {fileID: 0}
    requiredActionId: LoadASRS
    passiveAction: 0
    hintTarget: {fileID: 0}
    advanceOnNext: 0
    stationType: {fileID: 0}
    narration: {fileID: 0}
    media: {fileID: 0}
    largeText: 1
  - title: Module 1 Check
    targets: []
    infoText: Answer the three questions on the quiz panel. You need at least two
      correct to pass, and you can retry as often as you like.
    instructionsText: 
    RequiredOccupiedTable: {fileID: 0}
    RequiredLoadedSlottedTable: {fileID: 0}
    requiredActionId: M1_QuizPassed
    passiveAction: 0
    hintTarget: {fileID: 0}
    advanceOnNext: 0
    stationType: {fileID: 0}
    narration: {fileID: 0}
    media: {fileID: 0}
    largeText: 0
  infoPanel: {fileID: 204570909}
  nextButton: {fileID: 28556158}
  hintShowcase: {fileID: 0}
  hintButton: {fileID: 0}
  completionText: "Module 1 complete \u2014 you passed the check. You can now describe
    what an ASRS does, name the three storage station types, follow a pallet around
    the SmartCIM cell and find parts by their cell address."
  stationCard: {fileID: 0}
  narrationSource: {fileID: 1628413928}
  quizManager: {fileID: 0}
  onSequenceComplete:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  logTag: '[ASRS][Module1]'
